{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"The check will use a bootstrapped cluster with three voters and one nonvoter. After an applied command confirms the initial state, it will pause both replication and heartbeat calls at the transport boundary until prior replies have drained. It will then release one peer—first a nonvoter, then a voter in a separate control—and observe `VerifyLeader().Error()`. Lease checks remain active, and each pause is bounded."}}
